StarX embedded changes
------------------------------------------------------------
The embedded copy relocates upstream packages into the StarX namespace and
contains StarX-owned lifecycle and Velocity compatibility changes. The sync
process preserves these reviewed overrides:

  io/github/addxiaoyi/starx/limbo/LimboAPI.java
  io/github/addxiaoyi/starx/limbo/server/LimboImpl.java
  io/github/addxiaoyi/starx/limbo/server/LimboPlayerImpl.java
  io/github/addxiaoyi/starx/limbo/server/CachedPackets.java
  io/github/addxiaoyi/starx/limbo/injection/packet/UpsertPlayerInfoHook.java

The embedded runtime intentionally omits the upstream login-stage event hook;
StarX enters managed Uworld flows after Velocity login completes.

Generated mapping resources are imported from the matching LimboAPI dev-build
artifact vendored as limboapi-1.1.27-SNAPSHOT.jar. The pinned artifact SHA-256
is:

  18AC6287D413234C4FC317267A6D5DBF978ADAE8BF3F098A1248966BF2C32CE9

Operational boundary
------------------------------------------------------------
The only deployable StarX Velocity artifact is starx-velocity.jar. Uworld and
the embedded Limbo runtime are not separate plugins. Installing an external
LimboAPI plugin alongside StarX is unsupported.

Detailed provenance, synchronization instructions, and the upgrade checklist
are in starx-plugins/starx-standalone-limbo/UPSTREAM.md.

